{"id":"602989","name":"烧肉茄子三明治","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/602989/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"4片"},{"name":"烧肉","amount":"几片"},{"name":"土司","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许（或黄油）"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"切茄子片。","img":"images/602989/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"盘子里打一个鸡蛋，放小许食盐，搅散。","img":"images/602989/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放茄子片，均匀滚上蛋液。","img":"images/602989/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/602989/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"油热放茄子片。","img":"images/602989/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一面金黄翻面。","img":"images/602989/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"另一面也煎熟放一边，剩下的蛋液倒锅里。","img":"images/602989/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蛋液放上一片吐司。","img":"images/602989/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎金黄。","img":"images/602989/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出来放包装纸上。","img":"images/602989/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"另一片土司也抹点蛋液煎金黄即可。","img":"images/602989/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取烧肉。","img":"images/602989/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"烧肉放土司上。","img":"images/602989/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放芝士。","img":"images/602989/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放茄子。","img":"images/602989/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放上另一片土司，包起来。","img":"images/602989/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/602989/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"取三明治盒子。","img":"images/602989/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"装上三明治即可。","img":"images/602989/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/602989/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}